---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="AI Guide: The Unknowns Method | Shahar Kozniak"
  description="A practical guide to working well with AI models: the unknowns method and key techniques."
>
  <article class="guide">
    <header class="container g-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">Working with AI</p>
      <h1>
        How to work well with AI.<br />
        <span class="faded">The unknowns method.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="g-intro">
        Most problems come from the gap between what is in your head and what you actually wrote. Today's models are capable. The skill is noticing what you never said.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="band">
      <div class="container g-pad">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>The Four Quadrants</h2>
          <span class="section-num">01</span>
        </div>
        <div class="quad-grid">
          <div class="quad">
            <h3>Known knowns</h3>
            <p>What you said out loud. The model already has it.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="quad">
            <h3>Known unknowns</h3>
            <p>Open questions you know exist but have not decided yet.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="quad">
            <h3>Unknown knowns</h3>
            <p>Things so obvious to you that you never mentioned them.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="quad danger">
            <h3>Unknown unknowns</h3>
            <p>Things you do not even know exist. These surface late and cost the most.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="band">
      <div class="container g-pad">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>Key Techniques</h2>
          <span class="section-num">02</span>
        </div>

        <div class="tech">
          <h3>Blind Spot Pass</h3>
          <p>When entering a new domain: "I don't understand this. Tell me what I don't know."</p>
          <blockquote>"Give me a blindspot pass: help me identify my unknown unknowns."</blockquote>
        </div>

        <div class="tech">
          <h3>Let it interview you</h3>
          <p>You do not know what you forgot to say. Let the model ask.</p>
          <blockquote>"Before you start, interview me: one question at a time, starting with what changes the outcome most."</blockquote>
        </div>

        <div class="tech">
          <h3>See it before you build it</h3>
          <p>Ask for sketches or multiple directions before the real work.</p>
          <blockquote>"Build one HTML page with four completely different directions, and I'll react."</blockquote>
        </div>

        <div class="tech">
          <h3>Bring a reference</h3>
          <p>When words are not enough, show an example.</p>
          <blockquote>"Here's an example. Look at it and do mine in the same style."</blockquote>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="band">
      <div class="container g-pad">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>Quick Reference</h2>
          <span class="section-num">03</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cheat">
          <div class="c-row"><span class="c-when">New domain</span><span class="c-say">"Give me a blindspot pass."</span></div>
          <div class="c-row"><span class="c-when">Missing details</span><span class="c-say">"Interview me, one question at a time."</span></div>
          <div class="c-row"><span class="c-when">Before building</span><span class="c-say">"Show me several directions first."</span></div>
          <div class="c-row"><span class="c-when">Hard to explain</span><span class="c-say">"Here's an example. Match the style."</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .g-hero {
    padding-block: 72px 64px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: var(--text-title);
    max-width: 820px;
    margin-block: 24px 28px;
  }

  .faded {
    color: var(--ink-45);
  }

  .g-intro {
    max-width: 560px;
    font-size: var(--text-md);
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: var(--ink-70);
  }

  .g-pad {
    padding-block: 56px 64px;
  }

  .quad-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
  }

  .quad {
    padding: 24px 0 28px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
    padding-inline-end: 36px;
  }

  .quad h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-md);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .quad.danger h3 {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .quad p {
    font-size: var(--text-meta);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--ink-65);
  }

  .tech {
    padding-block: 26px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .tech h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-md);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .tech > p {
    font-size: var(--text-meta);
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--ink-70);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .tech blockquote {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 6%, transparent);
    border-inline-start: 2px solid var(--accent);
    font-size: var(--text-meta);
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .cheat {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
  }

  .c-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 240px 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
    padding-block: 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
  }

  .c-when {
    font-size: var(--text-meta);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .c-say {
    font-size: var(--text-meta);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--ink-65);
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .quad-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .quad {
      padding-inline-end: 0;
    }

    .c-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 4px;
    }
  }
</style>
